//
//  WHAT: The RR mark as a one-bit silhouette, 320 × 253, pressed into the centre of every Burgundy Seal.
//        Made once from rao.nyc's public/rr-mark.png (RR5, rao.nyc 68b3e72): alpha ≥ 128 and lightness
//        ≥ 70 (the baked shadow left out), closed 5 px and opened 3 px, cropped to the letters and scaled
//        to a long side of 320. Shipped as code, so VeilSeal carries no resources.
//  PIN:  Rows top first, each pixel one bit, most significant first, packed without row padding, then
//        base64. SHA-256 of the packed bits: c49fadd6c44d95da65d3981a91f1105f7811d84eb966e2702696a7742ffece06.
//

